<title>USA: Superior National names Senter exec VP.</title>
<headline>Superior National names Senter exec VP.</headline>
<dateline>CALABASAS, Calif. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior National Insurance Group said on Monday it has named Arnold Senter as executive vice president and chief operating officer of the company, a newly created position.</p>
<p>Senter was previously senior vice president of Zenith Insurance Co from 1980 to 1996, the company said.</p>
